      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "Their dashboards say exactly that and name bean `2krx`, rather than\nrendering zeros for a store nobody read — a dashboard that opens at zero is\nindistinguishable from a store with nothing in it, and those are opposite\nfacts.",
